<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Fire Sphere</h1>
<p>The spells of the fire sphere burn: the sorcerers' bolts and storms of flame, the dark knights' hellfire and brimstone, and the burning rays of the sun. Your ability in the sphere decides how well you cast them, and also how well you resist fire spells cast on you (see <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>). To resist fire better, see <a cmd='#'>Help Heat Resistance</a>; dragons may also breathe fire (see <a cmd='#'>Help Breath</a>).
</p><p>The spells, and who teaches them (guild level, and how far when a guild teaches less than 100%):
</p>
<pre>sun ray       healer 31 (up to 80%), druid 41
fire breath   no guild teaches it
sun beam      druid 24, healer 26 (up to 80%)
solar flare   druid 110
burn          sorcerer 0
fireball      sorcerer 14
firestorm     sorcerer 28
fire blast    sorcerer 150
lava flow     dark knight 11
hellfire      dark knight 32
brimstone     dark knight 80
soulfire      dark knight 100
</pre>
<p>Each spell has its own help: help and the spell's name.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Spheres</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Heat Resistance</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Sorcerer Spells</a>
</pre>




</div>